{"seq":1,"slug":"ci-pipeline-integration","title":"CI 流水线集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/e2e-test-automation/ci-integration/ci-pipeline-integration","wordCount":1096,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"ci-流水线集成\">CI 流水线集成</h1><p>E2E 测试的价值在被纳入 CI/CD 流水线后才真正释放——从&quot;开发者手动触发的验证脚本&quot;升级为&quot;每次代码变更的自动化质量门禁&quot;。集成的核心问题不是&quot;能不能跑&quot;，而是&quot;怎么跑得又快又可靠，失败时能阻断发布、通过时不拖慢交付&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>质量门禁（Quality Gate）</strong>：CI 中测试失败时自动阻断后续流程（合并/部署）的机制</li>\n<li><strong>分层触发</strong>：根据代码变更事件（Push/PR/合并/发布）运行不同范围的测试子集</li>\n<li><strong>产物收集</strong>：测试失败时自动保存 Trace/截图/视频/日志，支撑远程调试</li>\n<li><strong>选择性运行</strong>：基于 Git diff 分析变更影响范围，只运行相关测试以缩短反馈时间</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"集成架构\">集成架构</h2><h3 id=\"e2e-测试在流水线中的位置\">E2E 测试在流水线中的位置</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[代码推送] --&gt; B[构建 Build]&#10;    B --&gt; C[单元测试]&#10;    C --&gt; D[集成测试]&#10;    D --&gt; E[部署到测试环境]&#10;    E --&gt; F[E2E 测试]&#10;    F --&gt;|通过| G[部署到预发布]&#10;    F --&gt;|失败| H[阻断流水线]&#10;    G --&gt; I[验收测试]&#10;    I --&gt; J[生产部署]\">graph LR\n    A[代码推送] --&gt; B[构建 Build]\n    B --&gt; C[单元测试]\n    C --&gt; D[集成测试]\n    D --&gt; E[部署到测试环境]\n    E --&gt; F[E2E 测试]\n    F --&gt;|通过| G[部署到预发布]\n    F --&gt;|失败| H[阻断流水线]\n    G --&gt; I[验收测试]\n    I --&gt; J[生产部署]</pre><p>关键原则：E2E 测试必须在<strong>部署到测试环境之后</strong>运行——它验证的是部署后的真实系统行为，而非编译产物。</p>\n<h3 id=\"触发策略\">触发策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>运行范围</th>\n<th>超时限制</th>\n<th>门控行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每次 Push</td>\n<td>冒烟测试（5-10 个）</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>失败阻断 PR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 创建/更新</td>\n<td>回归测试子集</td>\n<td>15-30 分钟</td>\n<td>失败阻断合并</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并到主干</td>\n<td>完整回归套件</td>\n<td>30-60 分钟</td>\n<td>失败标记+告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定时（每日）</td>\n<td>全量 + 跨浏览器</td>\n<td>2 小时</td>\n<td>失败生成报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发布标签</td>\n<td>全量验收</td>\n<td>2 小时</td>\n<td>失败阻断发布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-实现\">GitHub Actions 实现</h2><h3 id=\"基础配置\">基础配置</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# .github/workflows/e2e.yml&#10;name: E2E Tests&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;  pull_request:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  e2e:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    timeout-minutes: 30&#10;&#10;    services:&#10;      postgres:&#10;        image: postgres:16-alpine&#10;        env:&#10;          POSTGRES_USER: test&#10;          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: test&#10;          POSTGRES_DB: testdb&#10;        ports: [&#39;5432:5432&#39;]&#10;        options: &gt;-&#10;          --health-cmd=&quot;pg_isready -U test&quot;&#10;          --health-interval=5s&#10;          --health-timeout=5s&#10;          --health-retries=10&#10;&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 22&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm build&#10;&#10;      - name: Install Playwright browsers&#10;        run: npx playwright install --with-deps chromium&#10;&#10;      - name: Start application&#10;        run: pnpm start &amp;&#10;        env:&#10;          DATABASE_URL: postgres://test:test@localhost:5432/testdb&#10;&#10;      - name: Wait for app&#10;        run: npx wait-on http://localhost:3000/health --timeout=60000&#10;&#10;      - name: Run E2E tests&#10;        run: npx playwright test&#10;        env:&#10;          BASE_URL: http://localhost:3000&#10;&#10;      - uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;        if: failure()&#10;        with:&#10;          name: playwright-report&#10;          path: playwright-report/&#10;          retention-days: 7\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/e2e.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">E2E Tests</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pull_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  e2e</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    timeout-minutes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      postgres</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16-alpine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          POSTGRES_USER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          POSTGRES_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          POSTGRES_DB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">testdb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5432:5432'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        options</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>-</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          --health-cmd=\"pg_isready -U test\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          --health-interval=5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          --health-timeout=5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          --health-retries=10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">22</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=